The uinput backend requires a per-user runit service.
The service definition is installed to /usr/share/examples/sv/fcitx5-lotus
but is not enabled automatically.

To enable for the current user:

cp -r /usr/share/examples/sv/fcitx5-lotus /etc/sv/fcitx5-lotus.$(whoami)
ln -s /etc/sv/fcitx5-lotus.$(whoami) /var/service/fcitx5-lotus.$(whoami)

To remove:

rm -f /var/service/fcitx5-lotus.*
rm -rf /etc/sv/fcitx5-lotus.*
